<title>CHINA: China Jan-Aug crude oil imports up 61 pct - customs.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Aug crude oil imports up 61 pct - customs.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's imports of crude oil soared by 61 percent in the first eight months to 14.3 million tonnes, customs figures showed on Saturday.</p>
<p>Imports of oil products rose by 16.9 percent to 10.05 million tonnes, the figures showed.</p>
</text>
